OL,3,GNEWSACommunity skips could stop
OL,4,A'persistent' fly-tips
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity skips could be introduced in
OL,7,Fa town to tackle "persistent"
OL,8,Ffly-tipping which is costing a council
OL,9,Fhundreds of thousands of pounds a year.
OL,11,FA pilot scheme hoped to be launched in
OL,12,Fa small number of areas, it forms part
OL,13,Fof a proposal brought to Swindon
OL,14,FBorough Council by Labour councillor
OL,15,FPrincia Fernandes.
OL,17,FIt comes as council figures show it
OL,18,Fspends more than #200,000 each year on
OL,19,Fcollecting fly-tipped waste and taking
OL,20,Fenforcement action.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
